  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a large saucepan over medium heat.",
    "Add grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add soy sauce and cook for an additional minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add Tunisian pilaf mix and cook, stirring frequently, for 2-3 minutes.",
    "Add quinoa and chicken broth, and bring to a boil.",
